WEBVTT

00:00:28.649 --> 00:00:30.777
between choices and dilemmas.

00:00:30.818 --> 00:00:32.862
Some decisions come down to choice.

00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:35.573
You weigh the alternatives,
decide and move on.

00:00:36.657 --> 00:00:40.119
But often complex situations
need both/and thinking

00:00:40.161 --> 00:00:41.746
instead of either/or.

00:00:42.288 --> 00:00:45.374
They require us to hold
competing values together

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:48.211
rather than make straightforward choices.

00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:50.630
We call these dilemmas.

00:00:50.671 --> 00:00:51.839
For example,

00:00:51.839 --> 00:00:55.301
there exists in any company a tension
between short-term profit

00:00:55.343 --> 00:00:56.969
and long-term investment.

00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:01.015
Pursuing profit alone comes
at the expense of future adaptation.